#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20006
#: f4413e141ca4460c8d669c6ca36fe7d8
msgid "Media Mix Modeling (MMM)"
msgstr "Modelado de mezcla de medios (MMM)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20008
#: 0c8db3c00438411ab9de7b4cae9ef71a
msgid ""
"MMM is a statistical technique used to measure the effectiveness of "
"marketing channels. A typical MMM decomposes sales into:"
msgstr ""
"MMM es una técnica estadística que se utiliza para medir la efectividad de "
"los canales de marketing. Un MMM típico descompone las ventas en:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20010
#: 8ec197555bed45a98d677b4d7d5215cd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"y_t = \\text{baseline}_t + \\sum_{c} f_c(\\text{media}_{c,t}) + \\sum_{j}"
" \\gamma_j z_{j,t} + \\varepsilon_t\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"y_t = \\text{baseline}_t + \\sum_{c} f_c(\\text{media}_{c,t}) + \\sum_{j} \\gamma_j z_{j,t} + \\varepsilon_t\n"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20014
#: c3bac2ecc9594e95975616621d1eb8a5
msgid "where:"
msgstr "donde:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20015
#: e73edc7739e34303b1da3da74d165730
msgid "$y_t$ is the target variable (e.g., sales) at time $t$"
msgstr ""
"$y_t$ es la variable objetivo (por ejemplo, las ventas) en el tiempo $t$"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20016
#: 797b8ed180ed47feb436dbf370468fb3
msgid ""
"$f_c(\\cdot)$ captures the nonlinear effect of media channel $c$, "
"typically including **adstock** (carryover effects) and **saturation** "
"(diminishing returns)"
msgstr ""
"$f_c(\\cdot)$ captura el efecto no lineal del canal de medios $c$, que "
"típicamente incluye **adstock** (efectos de arrastre) y **saturación** "
"(rendimientos decrecientes)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20017
#: 630794823cc243cfad3249ef324f3f9d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$z_{j,t}$ are **control variables** (e.g., economic indicators, weather, "
"holidays)"
msgstr ""
"$z_{j,t}$ son las **variables de control** (por ejemplo, indicadores "
"económicos, clima, feriados)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20018
#: 90be153d571b4f548bf6d3cb42586bb6
msgid "$\\gamma_j$ are the coefficients for control variables"
msgstr "$\\gamma_j$ son los coeficientes de las variables de control"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20019
#: 2dd8aa57a1ac49d5aabfb5c11a37ab71
msgid "$\\varepsilon_t$ is the error term"
msgstr "$\\varepsilon_t$ es el término de error"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20021
#: 3384ca7fc11b4b4086f55f1a7f6e4adb
msgid ""
"**Control variables** are external factors that influence sales but are "
"not marketing activities. Including them helps isolate the true media "
"effects from confounding factors."
msgstr ""
"Las **variables de control** son factores externos que influyen en las "
"ventas pero que no son actividades de marketing. Incluirlas ayuda a aislar "
"los verdaderos efectos de los medios de los factores de confusión."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:20023
#: 9cd57af9018e4a5f81b86935eedce027
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For more information on MMM, see the example notebooks  "
"{ref}`mmm_example` and {ref}`mmm_case_study`."
msgstr ""
