#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_chronos.ipynb:260025
#: e752b5ab114a4bc7a483fe746ed7b68b
msgid ""
"Experiment with different forecasting models for controls (e.g., Nixtla "
"Models, LightGBM, domain-specific models)"
